  "notes": "KANJI: Can be written as お{寝小|ねしょ}.\n\nWORD FORMATION: From お (honorific prefix) + {寝|ね} (sleep) + しょ (from おしっこ/{小便|しょうべん}).\n\nUSAGE: Functions as a noun and as a する verb (おねしょする).\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- おねしょをする (to wet the bed)\n- おねしょ{布団|ふとん} (bedwetting futon - one that got wet)\n\nRELATED WORDS: おもらし (wetting oneself while awake).\n\nMEDICAL TERM: {夜尿症|やにょうしょう} is the medical term for persistent bedwetting.",
